{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource containing cluster telemetry",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Reference dashboard for Kubernetes kubelet, Calico, control-plane, and OS-profile upgrade progress. This dashboard is only applicable to a GPU cluster. Requires k8s_cluster_name on kube-state-metrics series. Control-plane upgrade status and OS profile require NKE controller inventory metrics (cwe_* or nke_controller_*). Not deployed by nke-stack.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Requirements and scope",
      "description": "Metric assumptions and dependencies.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Scope\nThis dashboard is only applicable to a GPU cluster. It is an importable reference dashboard and is not deployed by nke-stack. Select a Prometheus datasource with kube-state-metrics from the selected GPU cluster. Controller inventory metrics add the control-plane upgrade and OS-profile panels; the kubelet panels can render without them.\n\n### Assumptions\n- Every queried kube-state-metrics series carries the Prometheus label `k8s_cluster_name` (from the OpenTelemetry resource attribute `k8s.cluster.name`).\n- **Target Kubernetes**, **target Calico**, and **target OS profile** are dashboard variables. They are policy choices used to compute \u201cat target\u201d and burndown panels. Target Kubernetes is matched against kubelet versions. A Calico cluster is at target only when every observed `calico/node` container is at the selected version; clusters with no Calico series are omitted from Calico progress.\n\n### Metric dependencies\n- **kube-state-metrics:** `kube_node_info` (kubelet version) and `kube_pod_container_info` (Calico `calico/node` image tag)\n- **NKE controller:** `cwe_cluster_info` / `nke_controller_cluster_info` (in-progress control-plane upgrades) and `cwe_node_info` / `nke_controller_node_info` (OS profile). These use `name` / `tenant_cluster` as the cluster identity matching the Cluster variable. See [dsx-ai-factory/nke](https://github.com/dsx-ai-factory/nke).\n\nController inventory and Calico metrics are needed only for their corresponding panels. If those series are absent, those panels stay empty while kubelet panels can still render."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Upgrade Summary",
      "description": "",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Clusters",
      "description": "Selected clusters from kube_node_info.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(group by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_node_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Count",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "In-progress control-plane upgrades",
      "description": "Requires cwe_cluster_info or nke_controller_cluster_info status labels.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(max by (name) ({__name__=~\"(cwe|nke_controller)_cluster_info\",name=~\"$cluster\",status=~\"control_plane_upgrading|cp_nodes_recycling\"})) or (0 * count({__name__=~\"(cwe|nke_controller)_cluster_info\",name=~\"$cluster\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "Count",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
